flowchart TB
    SRC[Data Sources]

    SRC --> INGEST[Ingestion Layer]
    INGEST --> STREAM[Stream Processing]
    INGEST --> BATCH[Batch Processing]

    STREAM --> LAKE[(Data Lake)]
    BATCH --> LAKE

    LAKE --> TRANSFORM[Transformation / ETL]
    TRANSFORM --> WAREHOUSE[(Data Warehouse)]

    WAREHOUSE --> BI[BI / Dashboards]
    WAREHOUSE --> ML[ML / Analytics]